{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/f457566f014493a6fc90e1c6444a7656.avif?t=1772155370\" width=1280 height=273 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAVE YOU EVER DREAMED OF STARTING YOUR OWN CULT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can - right from the comfort of your own home! Imagine the respect you\u2019ll receive as an up-and-coming cult leader! Issue weird teachings to your followers! Expand your territory! Build a base of operations! Perform sacrifices! Oversee a growing stockpile of military-grade weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sandbox survival game, your most valuable resource isn\u2019t stones and wood\u2026 it\u2019s human beings.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the world, from civilians to enemies, is a potential recruit for your growing cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the game world into your personal follower-farm by spreading propaganda, managing infamy, and making your cult worthy of joining. Once a new follower joins your flock, you can put them to work, play as them, or enlist their support on missions. All of your followers have strengths and weaknesses, and are best used in accordance with their abilities \u2013 farmers, smooth-talkers, doctors, etc.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers are your most important resource, but also your most volatile. If you don\u2019t keep them happy, they\u2019ll quit the cult. And remember\u2026 a cult leader without any followers is just a lonely weirdo.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn\u2019t be a cult unless your friends could join.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN US supports up to 4-player co-op. Work together to build the cult of your dreams and crush all those that try to oppose you. The end of the world depends on it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult\u2019s compound from the ground up. Design buildings and defenses, manage resources, put followers to work, and customize your home base! Every great cult starts with a great compound.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a unique belief system so that your followers can make it the centerpiece of their lives!<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you into? UFOs? Cannibalism? Intermittent fasting? All of the above? Maybe you just wanna hang around the drum circle and hammer out a sweet beat. The choice is yours, but choose wisely \u2013 once you convince your followers of a belief you\u2019ll need to live with the consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason people don\u2019t like it when you impose your radical lifestyle on them. Locals, police, and the government will try to put a stop to your fun. Fight back with a wide variety of weapons from shotguns, to miniguns, to snake launchers (if you were wondering, this is a gun that shoots live snakes).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful!\u00a0 JOIN US operates on a permadeath system \u2013 once a character dies, they stay dead forever (unless they become a ghost, but that\u2019s a whole other thing that we don\u2019t need to get into right now).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know this is kind of heavy - and we didn\u2019t want to be the ones to break it to you. But the Apocalypse <i>IS</i> coming.\u00a0 Planet Earth is going to be reborn. Your best chance to survive is to\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN US.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got it?\u00a0 Good.\u00a0 Now go forth and do cult stuff.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and please Wishlist.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3401960?t=1772155370","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/1d0116efa38dcd6f8161382910a19b7d4ad072a0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772155370","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/1b712b9a4b55cbaa991a1df02c8919102beb4485/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772155370","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/1b712b9a4b55cbaa991a1df02c8919102beb4485/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772155370","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Join Us is a satirical game based in the world of cults. It features violence and action inspired by grindhouse cinema from the 1970s. All of mature content is framed with humor and irreverence."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/f457566f014493a6fc90e1c6444a7656.avif?t=1772155370\" width=1280 height=273 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAVE YOU EVER DREAMED OF STARTING YOUR OWN CULT?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now you can - right from the comfort of your own home! Imagine the respect you\u2019ll receive as an up-and-coming cult leader! Issue weird teachings to your followers! Expand your territory! Build a base of operations! Perform sacrifices! Oversee a growing stockpile of military-grade weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sandbox survival game, your most valuable resource isn\u2019t stones and wood\u2026 it\u2019s human beings.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/c0215e7c34b2f607a93d5a27976a2682.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the world, from civilians to enemies, is a potential recruit for your growing cult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the game world into your personal follower-farm by spreading propaganda, managing infamy, and making your cult worthy of joining. Once a new follower joins your flock, you can put them to work, play as them, or enlist their support on missions. All of your followers have strengths and weaknesses, and are best used in accordance with their abilities \u2013 farmers, smooth-talkers, doctors, etc.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Followers are your most important resource, but also your most volatile. If you don\u2019t keep them happy, they\u2019ll quit the cult. And remember\u2026 a cult leader without any followers is just a lonely weirdo.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/5c549a5d54b1883f45fbd976188d93e1.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It wouldn\u2019t be a cult unless your friends could join.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JOIN US supports up to 4-player co-op. Work together to build the cult of your dreams and crush all those that try to oppose you. The end of the world depends on it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/564f53c3fedf853e7c7dc74d0d2f7f02.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your cult\u2019s compound from the ground up. Design buildings and defenses, manage resources, put followers to work, and customize your home base! Every great cult starts with a great compound.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/366c585f497e5f7fe4931bc52ea40522.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a unique belief system so that your followers can make it the centerpiece of their lives!<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What are you into? UFOs? Cannibalism? Intermittent fasting? All of the above? Maybe you just wanna hang around the drum circle and hammer out a sweet beat. The choice is yours, but choose wisely \u2013 once you convince your followers of a belief you\u2019ll need to live with the consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/818a09654de8606615ccf8c2e7c6f3f6.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason people don\u2019t like it when you impose your radical lifestyle on them. Locals, police, and the government will try to put a stop to your fun. Fight back with a wide variety of weapons from shotguns, to miniguns, to snake launchers (if you were wondering, this is a gun that shoots live snakes).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful!\u00a0 JOIN US operates on a permadeath system \u2013 once a character dies, they stay dead forever (unless they become a ghost, but that\u2019s a whole other thing that we don\u2019t need to get into right now).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.poster.avif?t=1772155370\" width=616 height=225 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/extras/a0e8129ea4d65bae95e411cdf5977bb2.webm?t=1772155370\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We know this is kind of heavy - and we didn\u2019t want to be the ones to break it to you. But the Apocalypse <i>IS</i> coming.\u00a0 Planet Earth is going to be reborn. Your best chance to survive is to\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN US.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Got it?\u00a0 Good.\u00a0 Now go forth and do cult stuff.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh and please Wishlist.</p>","developers":["Wolf Haus Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3401960/8d6f3ab1edcf0145fce796c7e329f86edb4730af/header.jpg?t=1772155370","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3401960/1881404862/1ea5990ce567ece811429ee0d579003c32414a4a/1772154575/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772155369","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3401960/1881404862/1ea5990ce567ece811429ee0d579003c32414a4